# saiku#1920 — who must review what.
#
# GitHub requests a review from these owners when a PR touches a matching path.
# It does NOT block anyone from pushing or from self-reviewing: the branch
# protection rules on `development` are what enforce "one maintainer approval",
# and CODEOWNERS sits underneath them as a routing layer. If a listed owner is
# inactive, GitHub falls back to the repository's default reviewers, so this
# never wedges a PR.
#
# The paths below are the ones where a mistake is a security incident rather
# than a bad UI state: the auth filters and the token stores that decide who may
# read what, the launcher that decides what the process is allowed to bind and
# dial, and the CI definition itself (a workflow edit is self-review, so it
# wants a second pair of eyes by construction).

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
* @spiculedata/maintainers

# --- CI / release / supply chain -------------------------------------------
# A workflow edit can exfiltrate secrets or ship a tampered artefact, and it is
# the one file class a contributor can always change in their own PR.
.github/ @spiculedata/maintainers

# --- Web security surface --------------------------------------------------
# Filters, token stores and the security packages: anything that grants a
# request an identity.
saiku-core/saiku-web/src/main/java/org/saiku/web/security/ @spiculedata/maintainers
saiku-core/saiku-web/src/main/java/org/saiku/web/embed/ @spiculedata/maintainers
saiku-core/saiku-web/src/main/java/org/saiku/web/share/ @spiculedata/maintainers
saiku-core/saiku-web/src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/saiku-beans.xml @spiculedata/maintainers
saiku-core/saiku-web/src/main/java/org/saiku/web/rest/SaikuJaxrsSecurityContextFilter.java @spiculedata/maintainers
saiku-core/saiku-service/src/main/java/org/saiku/service/user/ @spiculedata/maintainers

# --- Launcher ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Startup posture: default-admin refusal, bind address, which optional outbound
# integrations (telemetry, analytics) may dial.
saiku-launcher/ @spiculedata/maintainers

